(7546541, 1208457, 29777, '<td valign="top">There is so much to like about this shot. There is something technical I do not understand about this. Why is the tip of the pin not as in focus as the red drop?</td>', 'There is so much to like about this shot. There is something technical I do not understand about this. Why is the tip of the pin not as in focus as the red drop?', '2017-11-29 01:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546542, 1208680, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is so good. The textures and details. I would really like to know how you got this angle. Wow.</td>', 'This is so good. The textures and details. I would really like to know how you got this angle. Wow.', '2017-11-29 02:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7546543, 1208692, 29777, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a painting than a photo. Very nice.</td>', 'This looks more like a painting than a photo. Very nice.', '2017-11-29 02:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
