(7547380, 1208680, 173844, '<td valign="top">Remarkable study of this baby alligator, crisp, delicate and intimate.  Beyond the understatement of the minimal portrayal, its head barely cresting above the water, is the sense that he/she may be so newly born that what looks like filmy vegetation to the left could even be the tatters of the egg sack from which it''s just emerged.  The whipped cream, sprinkles and cherry is the incredible reflection of what I take to be water, trees and sky in this little fellow''s eye.  This lifts the image, excellent as it already is, into a higher realm of wonder, enchantment and epiphany.</td>', 'Remarkable study of this baby alligator, crisp, delicate and intimate.  Beyond the understatement of the minimal portrayal, its head barely cresting above the water, is the sense that he/she may be so newly born that what looks like filmy vegetation to the left could even be the tatters of the egg sack from which it''s just emerged.  The whipped cream, sprinkles and cherry is the incredible reflection of what I take to be water, trees and sky in this little fellow''s eye.  This lifts the image, excellent as it already is, into a higher realm of wonder, enchantment and epiphany.', '2017-12-05 17:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547384, 1208715, 138630, '<td valign="top">I hadn''t thought to make the title the understatement - nice interpretation.</td>', 'I hadn''t thought to make the title the understatement - nice interpretation.', '2017-12-05 17:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547386, 1208582, 138630, '<td valign="top">Definite understatement.</td>', 'Definite understatement.', '2017-12-05 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547387, 1208712, 138630, '<td valign="top">So I can only guess that the reason it''s on wrong is to emphasize the "under" in <br/>"Understatement" :)</td>', 'So I can only guess that the reason it''s on wrong is to emphasize the "under" in "Understatement" :)', '2017-12-05 18:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547391, 1208650, 61396, '<td valign="top">simple, dynamic, beautiful. a twirl.<br/> <br/>you get a balloon for an extra round:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1154420" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61396/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1154420.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61396/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1154420.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61396/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1154420.jpg"/></a></td>', 'simple, dynamic, beautiful. a twirl. you get a balloon for an extra round:', '2017-12-05 18:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547392, 1208637, 61396, '<td valign="top">hey, nice light!</td>', 'hey, nice light!', '2017-12-05 18:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547401, 1208582, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is impressive multitasking, especially since I suspect she''s holding her place on a unicycle.  It''s a sharply captured moment that is perfect for the challenge.  The picture of the calmly posed woman to the right is a great counterpoint to the woman on the left, and breaks the image wide open, for now there''s a story and philosophic overtones to ponder. Fine photo.</td>', 'Wow, this is impressive multitasking, especially since I suspect she''s holding her place on a unicycle.  It''s a sharply captured moment that is perfect for the challenge.  The picture of the calmly posed woman to the right is a great counterpoint to the woman on the left, and breaks the image wide open, for now there''s a story and philosophic overtones to ponder. Fine photo.', '2017-12-05 20:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547402, 1208695, 173844, '<td valign="top">It is understated and elegant, also shimmering and resplendent.  It''s also perfectly composed so as to highlight the silver/white reflections against the sky in a manner reminiscent of fountains.  The delicate tracery of the tree branches is interwoven into the background, further enhancing the sumptuous whole.  A joyful image.</td>', 'It is understated and elegant, also shimmering and resplendent.  It''s also perfectly composed so as to highlight the silver/white reflections against the sky in a manner reminiscent of fountains.  The delicate tracery of the tree branches is interwoven into the background, further enhancing the sumptuous whole.  A joyful image.', '2017-12-05 21:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547404, 1208715, 114285, '<td valign="top">Funny, bumping up.</td>', 'Funny, bumping up.', '2017-12-05 21:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547405, 1208705, 114285, '<td valign="top">It''s a kind gesture yes, but the guy needs a job, just saying :)</td>', 'It''s a kind gesture yes, but the guy needs a job, just saying :)', '2017-12-05 21:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547407, 1208650, 173844, '<td valign="top">A most lovely image.  On a cursory glance it seems simple, but in rushes a veritable bounty of textures, tones and planes supporting a mood of quiet happiness.  The composition is very interesting, a fullness of objects and motion on the right balanced by the bright expanse on the left, which draws the eye back across the scene.  The wing chair by the window calls for an essay on its own.  The girl is tenderly and beautifully portrayed.  Has she tossed off her sandals?  We can almost feel the fabric of the rug beneath her feet.</td>', 'A most lovely image.  On a cursory glance it seems simple, but in rushes a veritable bounty of textures, tones and planes supporting a mood of quiet happiness.  The composition is very interesting, a fullness of objects and motion on the right balanced by the bright expanse on the left, which draws the eye back across the scene.  The wing chair by the window calls for an essay on its own.  The girl is tenderly and beautifully portrayed.  Has she tossed off her sandals?  We can almost feel the fabric of the rug beneath her feet.', '2017-12-05 21:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547409, 1208648, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pastel still life.</td>', 'Beautiful pastel still life.', '2017-12-05 21:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547410, 1208468, 173844, '<td valign="top">I can''t put into words the mood that this elliptical image elicits in me, but I  find it very moving.  That''s it.  Thank you.</td>', 'I can''t put into words the mood that this elliptical image elicits in me, but I  find it very moving.  That''s it.  Thank you.', '2017-12-05 21:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547411, 1208714, 173844, '<td valign="top">Barber Shop, it says right up there, but offhand, and so you can then infer what''s happening within, but subtly.  And so it goes, a reluctant, beautiful flower coyly opening its petals in the night.  This image is outside and inside, bright and dark, message and mood.  I''m glad that it''s in black and white, and not leveled.  Even the obstructing car is really another curtain, and smoothly part of the scene.  A gem of understatement.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Barber Shop, it says right up there, but offhand, and so you can then infer what''s happening within, but subtly.  And so it goes, a reluctant, beautiful flower coyly opening its petals in the night.  This image is outside and inside, bright and dark, message and mood.  I''m glad that it''s in black and white, and not leveled.  Even the obstructing car is really another curtain, and smoothly part of the scene.  A gem of understatement.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-12-05 21:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547412, 1208665, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it''s the top of a mall or store and so fits the title and the challenge.  Which formally backs up my great appreciation for this almost abstract, processed beyond mere reality (whatever that is) and into the realm of dreams and second sight.  The small kernel of sharpness gives lift to the rest of the image.  The composition is elegant.  Quite artistic.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Perhaps it''s the top of a mall or store and so fits the title and the challenge.  Which formally backs up my great appreciation for this almost abstract, processed beyond mere reality (whatever that is) and into the realm of dreams and second sight.  The small kernel of sharpness gives lift to the rest of the image.  The composition is elegant.  Quite artistic.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2017-12-05 21:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547414, 1208684, 173844, '<td valign="top">Exciting and interesting image.  And after I''m done being mesmerized I love being able to explore the everyday world outside the tunnel.<br/>As a bonus there''s that neat effect at the far entrance when you rapidly shift the screen up and down.</td>', 'Exciting and interesting image.  And after I''m done being mesmerized I love being able to explore the everyday world outside the tunnel.As a bonus there''s that neat effect at the far entrance when you rapidly shift the screen up and down.', '2017-12-05 21:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547415, 1208671, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lovely image born from a whisper.</td>', 'A lovely image born from a whisper.', '2017-12-05 22:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547421, 1208690, 94815, '<td valign="top">I''m scoring this on how it could be without the vignette. Well not really. Could have been higher in a plain, understated rendition. 6</td>', 'I''m scoring this on how it could be without the vignette. Well not really. Could have been higher in a plain, understated rendition. 6', '2017-12-05 23:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7547422, 1208576, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very thoughtfully composed. Difficult to do with such clutter, but this really works and conjures up visions of olden says.</td>', 'Very thoughtfully composed. Difficult to do with such clutter, but this really works and conjures up visions of olden says.', '2017-12-05 23:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
