(7547444, 1208686, 138630, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get the understatement here.  For me, since it appears she is thoroughly enjoying it, "I like spaghetti bolognaise" would be an understatement.  But actually, this looks more like spaghetti carbonara to me :)</td>', 'I don''t quite get the understatement here.  For me, since it appears she is thoroughly enjoying it, "I like spaghetti bolognaise" would be an understatement.  But actually, this looks more like spaghetti carbonara to me :)', '2017-12-05 23:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
