(7547587, 1208681, 100831, '<td valign="top">Lovely! This was my high mark!</td>', 'Lovely! This was my high mark!', '2017-12-07 07:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7547592, 1208680, 47974, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=29777" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jbirkman</a> you are welcome and glad you enjoyed the read.  <br/> <br/>I have been around gators for many years now and while it is hazardous I take no unnessaccary chances.  I also dont recommend that anyone do some of the things I do without fully understanding gator behavior.<br/> <br/>But, gators are my favorite wildlife subject and I have spent most of the last 3 years learning how to photograph them.........which due to their size and low to the ground profile is not easy.</td>', ' Jbirkman you are welcome and glad you enjoyed the read.   I have been around gators for many years now and while it is hazardous I take no unnessaccary chances.  I also dont recommend that anyone do some of the things I do without fully understanding gator behavior. But, gators are my favorite wildlife subject and I have spent most of the last 3 years learning how to photograph them.........which due to their size and low to the ground profile is not easy.', '2017-12-07 08:50:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7547689, 1208690, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. Good exif. Im wondering which lens.  Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. Good exif. Im wondering which lens.  Congrats on the ribbon!', '2017-12-07 23:59:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7547704, 1208690, 94815, '<td valign="top">Paul, obviously the voters loved the vignette and I was an outsider. But I think you were right about having second thoughts. The plain version does seem a bit stark, and a bit of atmospheric framing does seem to be called for. Maybe less pronounced to my eye.</td>', 'Paul, obviously the voters loved the vignette and I was an outsider. But I think you were right about having second thoughts. The plain version does seem a bit stark, and a bit of atmospheric framing does seem to be called for. Maybe less pronounced to my eye.', '2017-12-08 00:16:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7547805, 1208622, 45631, '<td valign="top">Great spotting.  Lovely image.</td>', 'Great spotting.  Lovely image.', '2017-12-08 19:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7547806, 1208622, 45631, '<td valign="top">oops<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-12-08 19:34:20.</i></td>', 'oops', '2017-12-08 19:33:59.000000', '2017-12-08 19:34:20.000000', 0),
(7548047, 1208346, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An excellent image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Watt (sorry, just couldnt resist!) a lovely simple concept, it really is true the simpler the image the more effective it is and this certainly is very effective. Youve handled the lighting well, its inevitable given the nature of the subject you are going to get some unwanted reflections but these are minimal to the overall end result. The mono processing is good with a broad range of distinctive and subtle tones throughout. It would be difficult to improve on what you have so well done Joe for a great image, score and result.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An excellent image that meets the challenge well Watt (sorry, just couldnt resist!) a lovely simple concept, it really is true the simpler the image the more effective it is and this certainly is very effective. Youve handled the lighting well, its inevitable given the nature of the subject you are going to get some unwanted reflections but these are minimal to the overall end result. The mono processing is good with a broad range of distinctive and subtle tones throughout. It would be difficult to improve on what you have so well done Joe for a great image, score and result.', '2017-12-11 09:24:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7548051, 1208680, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An excellent image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Exquisitely done Ronnie! Yet again you are able to keep pushing the boundaries, another very striking gator, with that amazing eye staring at you, while at the same time reflecting the world around him. The shallow DOF works well emphasising that eye even more but what I like most is the mono processing this makes the end result even more focused. The content while striking is also quite minimal and fulfils the challenge brief, good score and position well done Ronnie</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An excellent image that meets the challenge well Exquisitely done Ronnie! Yet again you are able to keep pushing the boundaries, another very striking gator, with that amazing eye staring at you, while at the same time reflecting the world around him. The shallow DOF works well emphasising that eye even more but what I like most is the mono processing this makes the end result even more focused. The content while striking is also quite minimal and fulfils the challenge brief, good score and position well done Ronnie', '2017-12-11 09:36:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7548123, 1208671, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love this type of stuff. Well done!!<br/></td>', 'Love this type of stuff. Well done!!', '2017-12-12 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
